%% Proposed architecture only. Recommended hackathon option, not implemented.
flowchart LR
  U[User picker and question] --> I[Trusted identity and explicit time window]
  I --> M[Scoped memory pack<br/>3000 token default]
  P[(Private transcript<br/>summary and entity receipts)] --> M
  CAP[Always-loaded private static-fact capsule<br/>source IDs and archival expansion] --> M
  M --> A[Bounded planner<br/>Gemma through OpenRouter]
  A --> G[Validated typed tool gateway]
  G --> E[Exact effective-record calculations]
  G --> D[Linked reports and applicable rules]
  R[(Immutable source records)] --> E
  R --> D
  K[(Shared correction<br/>claim and type-rule ledger)] --> E
  K --> D
  I --> F[Explicit feedback classification]
  F --> W[Validated idempotent write]
  W --> K
  W --> V[Knowledge revision and invalidation]
  E --> S[Immutable result sets<br/>with evidence and revision]
  D --> S
  S --> C[Specialist composer]
  C --> J[Local schema and evidence validation<br/>one formatting repair maximum]
  J --> UI[Narrative and 1 to 5 inline blocks]
  J --> P
  P --> T[Every 10 completed exchanges<br/>or earlier token overflow]
  T --> P
  V --> G
